# Metric-compatible stand-in for Cambria, which ships only as a TTC collection
# the msttcore helper skips. workstation-install-microsoft-fonts used to fetch
# it from a pinned PowerPointViewer.exe until the mirror started serving a
# different artifact; this package needs no download and no pin. Its own
# 30-0-google-crosextra-caladea-fonts.conf aliases the Cambria family name, and
# its 62- rule does not take the generic serif away from Noto Serif.
google-crosextra-caladea-fonts
# GAP: FiraCode Nerd Font Mono is referenced by fontconfig/fonts.conf and by
# dms-settings.json monoFontFamily, but is not in any image -- on this machine
# fc-list resolves it from ~/.local/share/fonts/FiraCode, owned by no package.
# Installed via a sha256-pinned GitHub release in build_files/00-toolchain.sh so
# it is pinnable and adds no repo. 99-check-build.sh gates on fc-list.
